                "description": "The Porcelain Madison Ivory Knob with Traditional Arched Rose looks like it comes strait out of the victorian era. There is something so beautifully old world about the pairing of the white porcelain knob with the wrought steel rose. Emtek's Arched #1 Rosette is available in black steel or satin steel finishes. The Madison Ivory Knobset with Modern #1 Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
